**Known for**: Louis Rossmann YouTube channel, FUTO, right to repair

**Alias**: larossmann

Louis is a prominent right to repair activist who runs a popular YouTube
channel on the subject. He worked with FUTO, [Eron
Wolf]($link.page('weird-guys').unsafeRef('ewolf')), from August 2022 to
February 2025, and his right-to-repair non-profit received a $1M donation from
Wolf.[[source]][0][[source]][1]

On August 3rd, 2026, Louis posted a video about openly transgender Colorado
state representative Brianna Titone, and in the YouTube comments posted a
remark explaining his position on transgender issues, which can be paraphrased
as "I think transgender women are men but I'm willing to overlook it if we have
common cause".[[source]][2]

Louis has been a regular poster on the hate and harassment website Kiwi Farms,
posting there from 2023 to the present under the username "larossmann".

